# Dependencies and Wrangler's local state (it can hold cached responses and Durable Object data)
node_modules/
.wrangler/

# Secrets for local development: never commit these. Production secrets live in Cloudflare
# (`npx wrangler secret put`), not in files.
.dev.vars*
.env*
*.pem
*.key

# Claude Code: worktrees (whole checkouts of other branches), per-user settings and the maintainer's private
# notes stay on this machine. .claude/launch.json (dev-server configs for the desktop app) is shared on purpose.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/SESSION_CONTEXT.md
.claude/reference-pages-plan.md

# Editors, operating systems and logs
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
